[node name="HorizonSkirt" type="MeshInstance3D" parent="."]
; Low-LOD baked mesh of the whole archipelago. Always visible past
; Zylann's view_distance so distant peaks read at any distance.
; Loads res://assets/voxel/copper_isles_skirt.res produced by the
; SkirtBaker (button in scenes/_dev/BakeWorld.tscn). Hides itself
; if the file isn't on disk yet.
;
; Parented to the scene root (NOT to VoxelLodTerrain) because the
; skirt was baked in WORLD metres and shouldn't inherit the
; terrain's 1/6 scale. The scene root sits at unit scale, so the
; skirt's vertex coordinates land at the right world position.
script = ExtResource("4_skirt")

